sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as League portal / mobile app
    participant C as MemberProfileController
    participant S as MemberProfileService
    participant MD as MemberDomain service
    participant SR as segment / segment_rule
    participant PR as family_permission_rule
    participant RC as relationship_code / action_code
    participant FC as family_consent
    participant SE as SegmentationEvaluator
    participant PE as PermissionEvaluator

    L->>C: GET /api/v1/members/{memberId}/profile
    C->>S: profile(memberId, impersonating, explain)
    S->>MD: GET /members/{memberId}
    MD-->>S: member, attributes (rule facts), familyMembers[]
    Note over S: company, actor age from the member record

    rect rgb(235, 243, 255)
        Note over S,SE: Segmentation (logged-in member only)
        S->>SR: active segments
        S->>SR: active rules WHERE company = :company
        SR-->>S: rows ordered by segment, rule_group, evaluation_order
        S->>SE: evaluate(segments, rules, attributes)
        SE-->>S: {onlineBillPay: true, optumRxCoverage: false, ...}
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 238)
        Note over S,PE: Family permissions (self + each family member)
        S->>RC: relationship codes, action codes
        RC-->>S: 01 Subscriber, 03 Child, ... / 1 View, 2 Edit, 3 Download, 4 Delete
        Note over S: actor relationship = f(relationshipCode, age)<br/>e.g. Subscriber, Spouse, Child (teenager)
        S->>PR: active rules WHERE actor_relationship = :actor
        PR-->>S: rows for every viewing relationship and age band
        S->>FC: active consents WHERE actor_member_id = :memberId
        FC-->>S: (viewedMemberId, permissionFamily) pairs
        loop self, then each family member
            Note over S: viewing relationship = f(actor, viewed code, viewed age)<br/>Self, Subscriber, Spouse, Child, Adult dependent, All other
            S->>PE: evaluate(actorRules, viewing, viewedAge, viewedMemberId, consents)
            PE-->>S: permissions map, consentRequired[], masked[]
        end
    end

    S-->>C: MemberProfileResponse
    C-->>L: 200 JSON: member, segmentation, selfPermissions, familyPermissions, actionCodes, meta
